OL,3,GNEWSAI had to crawl on my hands and
OL,4,Aknees to get off train, says disabled
OL,5,Awoman
OL,6,
OL,7,FA wheelchair user was left in tears as
OL,8,Fshe crawled on her "hands and knees"
OL,9,Fthrough a train after being told a ramp
OL,10,Fcould not be used to help her off.
OL,12,FPhoebe Tesoriere, 24, was on a Great
OL,13,FWestern Railway (GWR) train from London
OL,14,FPaddington to Bath Spa with her parents
OL,15,Fwhen it happened.
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBWales NewsC Reg TVFClean Feed
FL,432,430,260,140,0,100
