OL,2,W//%*// //%Q-.,%%**,$-,(,% ,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,GNEWSAI had to crawl on my hands and
OL,4,Aknees to get off train, says disabled
OL,5,Awoman
OL,6,
OL,7,FHer family spoke to the assistance desk
OL,8,Fand were taken to the only designated
OL,9,Fwheelchair space on the train. Phoebe
OL,10,Fsaid she was assured a ramp and
OL,11,Fassistance would be waiting, but on
OL,12,Farrival was told she was in a carriage
OL,13,Fbeyond the platform, leaving her unable
OL,14,Fto get off.
OL,16,FGWR said it was "really sorry" and
OL,17,Fadmitted "we let her down, both when we
OL,18,Fhelped her board and at several points
OL,19,Fduring her journey".
OL,23,APub: 05-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
